{"complete":true,"school_name":"Salisbury University","town_name":"Salisbury","boards":[{"complete":true,"school_name":"Salisbury University","town_name":"Salisbury","template_id":"college-campus-tour-skips","title":"What the Campus Tour Skips: 10 Places Students Share With Each Other","description":"Ten named campus spaces for studying, making, meeting, and getting between main and east campus, documented by Salisbury University sources.","icon":"style","cards":[{"subject_id":"guerrieri-academic-commons","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Guerrieri Academic Commons","title":"Guerrieri Academic Commons","subtitle":"Main library and academic hub","notes":"Use the main library as a flexible reset point: pick a study seat, meet a project partner, borrow needed equipment, or ask library staff for help.","short_summary":"A four-floor academic commons combining research help, library collections, study areas, and campus services.","evidence_claim":"SU describes the Guerrieri Academic Commons as its main library and a place to study, collaborate, borrow a laptop, work on projects, and meet friends.","source_url":"https://www.salisbury.edu/libraries/about/gac.aspx","source_title":"Guerrieri Academic Commons | Salisbury University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A Gull Card is required for entry during certain hours; visitors may enter during designated visitor-access hours.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gac-group-study-rooms","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Guerrieri Academic Commons Group Study Rooms","title":"Book a GAC group study room","subtitle":"Second floor, Guerrieri Academic Commons","notes":"Reserve a room when your group needs a table, whiteboard, and display. Choose the room size for four, eight, or up to 10 people before meeting.","short_summary":"Thirteen reservable second-floor rooms support small and medium group work.","evidence_claim":"The GAC has 13 group study rooms on its second floor, reservable by SU students, faculty, and staff, with rooms seating 4, 8, or 10.","source_url":"https://www.salisbury.edu/libraries/spaces-tech/reserve-space.aspx","source_title":"Reserve a Study Room or Carrel | Salisbury University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Reservations are limited to SU students, faculty, and staff; use the library’s room-availability schedule to book.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gac-study-carrels","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Guerrieri Academic Commons Study Carrels","title":"Settle into a GAC study carrel","subtitle":"Third floor, Guerrieri Academic Commons","notes":"Choose a carrel for a quiet solo session. Reserve one ahead when you need consistency, or check the first-come options when you arrive.","short_summary":"Enclosed desks in designated quiet areas provide an individual-work alternative to open seating.","evidence_claim":"The GAC offers 28 reservable third-floor study carrels plus first-come carrels; they are in quiet areas and can be reserved for up to 14 days.","source_url":"https://www.salisbury.edu/libraries/spaces-tech/reserve-space.aspx","source_title":"Reserve a Study Room or Carrel | Salisbury University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use the library availability schedule for reservable carrels; other carrels are first-come, first-served.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"su-libraries-makerlab","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"SU Libraries MakerLab","title":"Make a prototype at the MakerLab","subtitle":"GAC Room 118","notes":"Bring a project idea to the staff and ask what proc