ess fits it. The lab supports 3D printing, scanning, laser work, and other maker tools.","short_summary":"A staffed GAC workshop for hands-on design, fabrication, and experimentation.","evidence_claim":"SU says the MakerLab in GAC Room 118 offers 3D printing, 3D scanning, laser cutting and engraving, and staff help for projects.","source_url":"https://www.salisbury.edu/libraries/spaces-tech/makerlab.aspx","source_title":"SU Libraries MakerLab | Salisbury University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Appointments are not required during fall and spring semesters; visit during regular MakerLab hours or make an appointment to prepare for a visit.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"university-writing-center","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"University Writing Center","title":"Talk through a draft at the Writing Center","subtitle":"AC 260, second floor of Guerrieri Academic Commons","notes":"Make an appointment or bring a draft at any stage. Peer consultants can help you talk through papers and projects rather than simply proofread them.","short_summary":"A second-floor peer-consultation space for working on writing projects at any stage.","evidence_claim":"The University Writing Center in AC 260 has trained peer consultants who work with students on papers and projects at any stage of the writing process.","source_url":"https://www.salisbury.edu/administration/academic-affairs/university-writing-center/faculty-resources.aspx","source_title":"University Writing Center Faculty Resources | Salisbury University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in Guerrieri Academic Commons Room 260; consult the Writing Center’s appointment information before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"edward-h-nabb-research-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Edward H. Nabb Research Center for Delmarva History and Culture","title":"Browse Delmarva history at the Nabb Center","subtitle":"AC 430, fourth floor of Guerrieri Academic Commons","notes":"Plan a research or exhibit stop around local history, university archives, and special collections. Begin with the reading room and ask staff about the materials.","short_summary":"A fourth-floor repository and exhibit space for Delmarva history, university archives, and special collections.","evidence_claim":"SU identifies the Nabb Center in AC 430 as a repository for local history and culture, university archives, and special collections serving SU and surrounding communities.","source_url":"https://www.salisbury.edu/libraries/about/locations.aspx","source_title":"Visit Our Locations | Salisbury University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located on the fourth floor of the Guerrieri Academic Commons; review the Nabb Center’s planning-a-visit information before going.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fireside-lounge","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Fireside Lounge","title":"Take a break in Fireside Lounge","subtitle":"Guerrieri Student Union","notes":"Use the lounge for a low-key break with friends, a game of billiards or ping pong, or a quieter stop between classes in the Student Union.","short_summary":"A GSU lounge furnished for casual gathering and tabletop games.","evidence_claim":"SU invites students to use Fireside Lounge in the Guerrieri Student Union for billiards, ping pong, and gathering with fellow Sea Gulls.","source_url":"https://www.salisbury.edu/administration/student-affairs/guerrieri-student-union/meeting-rooms.aspx","source_title":"Meeting Rooms & Lounges | Salisbury University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The University lists GSU Fireside Lounge hours as 6 a.m.–midnight daily; check current building access before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hardwood-lounge","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Hardwood Lounge","title":"Meet up in Hardwood Lounge","subtitle":"Guerrieri Student Union","notes":"Use the adjacent lounge for a casual group pause or a game. Its pool tables, ping pong table, TV, and large couch make it suited to shared downtime.","short_summary":"A Student Union lounge with game tables, a large couch, and a television.","evidence_claim":"SU’s Guerrieri Student Union materials list Hardwood Lounge amenities including two pool tables, a ping pong table, a 72-inch TV, and a large U-shaped couch.","source_url":"https://www.salisbury.edu/administration/student-affairs/conference-services/_files/gsu.pdf?v=20250920024917","source_title":"Guerrieri Student Union | Salisbury University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-11-13","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The University notes that Hardwood Lounge is usually booked with Fireside Lounge; confirm availability with Student Union facilities reservations.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"the-square","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"The Square","title":"Use The Square as your campus landmark","subtitle":"Brick area in front of Guerrieri Academic Commons","notes":"Use this brick plaza as a clear meeting point before heading into the library or across campus. It is named in SU’s orientation guide and pictured there.","short_summary":"The named brick area directly in front of Guerrieri Academic Commons.","evidence_claim":"Salisbury University’s orientation guide defines The Square as the brick area that sits in front of the Guerrieri Academic Commons.","source_url":"https://www.salisbury.edu/admissions/orientation/su-lingo.aspx","source_title":"SU Lingo Guide | Salisbury University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor campus plaza; use standard campus pedestrian access and observe any event setup or construction notices.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"the-tunnel","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"The Tunnel","title":"Walk The Tunnel to east campus","subtitle":"Underground pathway to east campus and Avery Lot","notes":"Take this marked underground path when you are moving between main and east campus. Treat it as a route connector and stay alert to regular pedestrian traffic.","short_summary":"A named underground pedestrian pathway connecting toward east campus and Avery Lot.","evidence_claim":"Salisbury University’s orientation guide defines The Tunnel as the underground pathway to the east part of campus and Avery Lot.","source_url":"https://www.salisbury.edu/admissions/orientation/su-lingo.aspx","source_title":"SU Lingo Guide | Salisbury University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use as a pedestrian route; follow posted campus safety guidance and any temporary access notices.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
